Newsletter Search Search News Reviews Best New Music Features Lists Columns Video Open Navigation Menu Menu Search Search News Olivia Rodrigo Delivers Another Christmas Song Listen to “Miss This Christmas” By Jazz Monroe November 27, 2026 Olivia Rodrigo’s “Miss This Christmas” art Comment Loader Save Story Save this story Comment Loader Save Story Save this story Three weeks after slipping into her Santa hat for “Take Me Home (4 Christmas),” Olivia Rodrigo has come through with another holiday single. “Miss This Christmas” serves as a gift to both her fans and the retail conglomerate Amazon, where it lives as an exclusive. Listen to a minutelong preview below; Prime subscribers can hear the whole song at Amazon Music .

The song, billed as a B-side to the previous single, is again co-written by Rodrigo, Dan Nigro, and Amy Allen, with Nigro producing. “Take Me Home (4 Christmas)” was Rodrigo’s first-ever Christmas song and her latest post-release single after You Seem Pretty Sad For a Girl So in Love .

